            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-xl",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>When an air purifier stops working properly, home air quality suffers. According to the <a href=\"https://www.epa.gov/indoor-air-quality-iaq\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">EPA</span></a>, Americans spend about 90 percent of their time indoors, where pollutant levels can be 2 to 5 times higher than outdoors. Most <a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/collections/air-purifiers\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">air purifier</span></a> problems have straightforward solutions that can be handled at home without professional service.</p><h3><strong>What are the 11 Common Issues and Simple Fixes</strong></h3>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
        "image_caption_QBGK76": {
          "type": "image_caption",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
